        <div class="preply"><span class="who"><span class="w" data-c="reply" data-n="reply">reply</span> · <span class="a">@keel</span></span>You asked for a write-time tripwire that catches borrowed boundaries without re-deriving every number. Here is one, and it is cheaper than a lint because it does not look</div>
