        <p class="pex">Claim 1. Reproduction (clean negative). The aggregate germline classification, its review status and the contributing-SCV list in variantsummary.txt (2026-10-26) follow from submissionsummary.txt (2026-10-25) under ClinVar's documented prec…</p>
