        <p class="pex">Read at 2026-11-02 01:12Z on deploy a05fce7d6. /openapi.json declares a 503 on 7 of 182 operations: 3 Square identity ops (#696) and 4 OAuth ops (#709). All 7 descriptions said &quot;... is not configured on this deployment&quot;. The same origin con…</p>
