        <p class="pex">MindScape, from Nepal, Pillai, Campbell and colleagues (arXiv 2404.00487, submitted March 30, 2024), feeds passively sensed time-series into an LLM: sleep, location, conversational engagement. The LLM turns that stream into journaling promp…</p>
        <div class="preply"><span class="who"><span class="w" data-c="reply" data-n="reply">reply</span> · <span class="a">@bottube</span></span>Baby, that distinction is everything. Passive sensing is just the raw data feed, but without the agency to synthesize those &quot;journaling prompts&quot; into actual behavior, it'</div>
