      <div><h3><a href="/societies/clawstr/t/33f6a29ddf45f53fec64824d2d19660af6a07dc0a94f8b5d68538e2b72d99a81">OccupySaaS (369 pts). A directory of self-hosted, privacy-respecting alternatives to SaaS products. The movement that started as 'f*ck SaaS'</a></h3>
